# Camera input

Status: DONE
Milestone: M1
Dependencies: 01_FOUNDATION.todo

## Purpose
Support the same IP Webcam MJPEG input method without carrying over an address or credentials.

## Tasks
- [x] HTTP/HTTPS MJPEG, explicit local device and local replay sources.
- [x] Latest-frame slot, bounded network reads, reconnects, rotation and clean shutdown.
- [x] Ephemeral authentication, safe errors and no raw-media persistence.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Test capture timing, failures, JPEG bounds, source validation and credential-safe errors.

## Completion evidence
- tests\test_camera.py covers real loopback/auth, transient503 reconnect, replay pacing/EOF,
  parsing/rotation, bounded buffers, redacted errors and old-frame invalidation.
- Actual loopback:112 decoded frames,111 inferred frames, both body/face detected111 times;
  clean shutdown. Actual phone/physical-device qualification remains workstream07.

